#━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# mk-go configuration (Docker)
#
# このファイルは `.config/docker.yml.example` です。
# Dockerfile が build 時に `.config/docker.yml.example` を image 内の
# `/app/.config/default.yml` として焼き込みます。docker-compose の
# 既定値 (POSTGRES_USER=misskey / POSTGRES_PASSWORD=misskey) と
# 整合する内容を初期値にしてあるので、`docker compose up` で out-of-
# the-box に動作します。
#
# 設定をカスタマイズする場合:
#   1. cp .config/docker.yml.example .config/docker.yml
#   2. .config/docker.yml を編集
#   3. docker-compose.yml の `volumes:` で
#        - ./.config/docker.yml:/app/.config/default.yml:ro
#      を有効化して mount 上書き
#━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

#   ┌─────┐
#───┘ URL └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Final accessible URL seen by a user.
url: http://localhost:3000

# ONCE YOU HAVE STARTED THE INSTANCE, DO NOT CHANGE THE
# URL SETTINGS AFTER THAT!

#   ┌───────────────────────┐
#───┘ Port and TLS settings └───────────────────────────────────

port: 3000

#   ┌──────────────────────────┐
#───┘ PostgreSQL configuration └────────────────────────────────

db:
  host: db
  port: 5432

  # Database name
  db: misskey

  # Auth — docker-compose.yml の POSTGRES_USER / POSTGRES_PASSWORD と
  # 同じ値にしておく (out-of-the-box で接続できるように)。
  # 本番運用では強いパスワードに変更すること。
  user: misskey
  pass: misskey

  # Whether disable Caching queries
  #disableCache: true

  # Extra Connection options
  # `ssl: true` enables TLS and verifies the server certificate and hostname
  # against the system CAs (same as upstream node-postgres). NOTE: earlier
  # mk-go versions did not verify. For a self-signed / private CA, point
  # `sslrootcert` at the CA file; to explicitly skip verification (exposes
  # the connection to interception) use `ssl: { rejectUnauthorized: false }`
  # (or `ssl: no-verify`).
  # `sslmode` (libpq value) may be set instead of `ssl`. See docs/configuration.md.
  #extra:
  #  ssl: true
  #  sslrootcert: /etc/ssl/certs/pg-ca.pem

dbReplications: false

# You can configure any number of read replicas here
#dbSlaves:
#  -
#    host:
#    port:
#    db:
#    user:
#    pass:

#   ┌─────────────────────┐
#───┘ Redis configuration └─────────────────────────────────────

redis:
  host: redis
  port: 6379
  #family: 0  # 0=Both, 4=IPv4, 6=IPv6
  #pass: example-pass
  #prefix: example-prefix
  #db: 1

#redisForPubsub:
#  host: redis
#  port: 6379

#redisForJobQueue:
#  host: redis
#  port: 6379

#redisForTimelines:
#  host: redis
#  port: 6379

#redisForReactions:
#  host: redis
#  port: 6379

#   ┌───────────────────┐
#───┘ Job queue driver └────────────────────────────────────────

# mk-go specific: select the job queue runtime.
#
#   - 'mkq' (the only driver): shiroha-a/mkq based, BullMQ wire-
#                         compatible (makes the admin queue dashboard
#                         render correctly under the upstream Misskey
#                         TS frontend) + supports per-queue concurrency
#                         and rate-limit knobs.
#
# The legacy 'asynq' driver was removed in mk-go (#2985). A config that
# still pins it fails to start: set 'mkq' or delete the line.
#
# Migrating is ONE-WAY: asynq's queued jobs (`asynq:{<queue>}:*` in Redis)
# are invisible to mkq (`bull:*`). Drain them with the PREVIOUS mk-go
# build before upgrading — the new build refuses to start, so there is no
# way to drain them afterwards.
#
#jobQueueDriver: mkq

#   ┌───────────────────────────────┐
#───┘ Fulltext search configuration └─────────────────────────────

fulltextSearch:
  # - sqlLike (default), sqlPgroonga, meilisearch
  provider: sqlLike

#meilisearch:
#  host: meilisearch
#  port: 7700
#  apiKey: ''
#  ssl: true
#  index: ''
#  scope: local

#   ┌───────────────┐
#───┘ ID generation └───────────────────────────────────────────

# Available methods: aid, aidx, meid, ulid, objectid
# ONCE YOU HAVE STARTED THE INSTANCE, DO NOT CHANGE.

id: 'aidx'

#   ┌────────────────┐
#───┘ Error tracking └──────────────────────────────────────────

#sentryForBackend:
#  options:
#    dsn: 'https://examplePublicKey@o0.ingest.sentry.io/0'

#   ┌─────────────────────┐
#───┘ Job queue settings └──────────────────────────────────────

#deliverJobConcurrency: 128
#inboxJobConcurrency: 16

#deliverJobPerSec: 128
#inboxJobPerSec: 32

# Job attempts (total tries incl. the first). Defaults match Misskey:
# deliver=12, inbox=8. Set to 1 to disable retries to a failing remote.
#deliverJobMaxAttempts: 12
#inboxJobMaxAttempts: 8

# Auto-scale: when jobQueueAutoScale=true, an AIMD controller dynamically
# resizes worker pools for queues without an explicit *JobConcurrency knob,
# within [minWorkers, maxWorkers]. Full spec:
# docs/design/auto-scale-job-workers.md.
#jobQueueAutoScale: false
#maxWorkers: 128                # per-queue upper bound (default: runtime.NumCPU() * 16)
#minWorkers: 4                  # per-queue lower bound (kept warm even at idle)
#maxWorkersGlobal: 256          # cluster-wide cap across queues for multi-pod use (default: unset = no cap)
#autoScaleCooldownSeconds: 1    # minimum interval between scale events (5-10 recommended in production to avoid oscillation)

#   ┌─────────────────────┐
#───┘ Other configuration └─────────────────────────────────────

#disableHsts: true

#outgoingAddressFamily: ipv4

# When set, **every third-party outbound HTTP/HTTPS request** mk-go makes is
# routed through this proxy: ActivityPub delivery, WebFinger, media proxy,
# summary (URL preview) target fetch, webhook delivery, Web Push, and SaaS
# APIs (hCaptcha / reCAPTCHA / Turnstile / mCaptcha / DeepL / Truemail /
# Verifymail, etc.). Use this to centralize egress or to keep the origin IP
# hidden. Hosts that must bypass the proxy (exact hostname match) go in
# proxyBypassHosts below.
# Note: operator-trusted endpoints configured via `urlPreviewSummaryProxyUrl`
# (the summaly proxy itself) are called directly so that internal/localhost
# summaly deployments keep working.
# Destination check: for every request that goes through the proxy, mk-go
# resolves the destination host itself and refuses to hand it to the proxy
# when any address is private / reserved (allowedPrivateNetworks still
# applies). The proxy re-resolves the name on its own, so a DNS rebinding
# window remains: configure the proxy to deny private, loopback and
# link-local destinations (e.g. 169.254.169.254) as well. Destinations that
# cannot be resolved locally are not forwarded either.
# Numeric hosts that are not a plain dotted quad (0x7f.1, 2130706433, 127.1)
# are refused, since the proxy may read them as 127.0.0.1.
#proxy: http://127.0.0.1:3128

# Hosts that bypass `proxy` (exact hostname match).
proxyBypassHosts:
  - api.deepl.com
  - api-free.deepl.com
  - www.recaptcha.net
  - hcaptcha.com
  - challenges.cloudflare.com

#proxySmtp: http://127.0.0.1:3128

#mediaProxy: https://example.com/proxy

# Video thumbnail generator. docker-compose.yml に `video-thumb` service
# (nekonoverse/video-thumb) を同梱しているが default では disabled。
# 動画サムネを生成したい operator は docker-compose.yml の `video-thumb`
# block と以下の行を両方コメントアウト解除する。
# 設定が無ければ mk-go は video request に dummy PNG を返すだけで外部
# generator を呼ばない。default wire mode "post" は multipart bytes 転送、
# Misskey TS 互換の "get" 経路は default.yml.example を参照。
#videoThumbnailGenerator: http://video-thumb:8005
#videoThumbnailGeneratorMode: post

# NSFW sensitive media detection (#406). Disabled by default. The operator
# runs any compatible service and points this at its URL. The wire spec
# and reference compatible images are documented in default.yml.example.
#nsfwDetectorUrl: http://nsfw-detector:8080/score

#allowedPrivateNetworks:
#  - '127.0.0.1/32'

#maxFileSize: 262144000

#logging:
#  sql:
#    enableQueryParamLogging: false
#    disableQueryTruncation: false

# Expose the Prometheus /metrics endpoint with job-queue metrics.
# Unauthenticated; restrict access via nginx / LB ACL if exposed outside
# the cluster. See docs/design/auto-scale-job-workers.md §6.1.
#enableMetrics: false

# Maximum successful effective-policy entries retained per provider.
# Non-positive values use the default 10000. Changes require a restart.
#effectivePolicyProviderCacheEntries: 10000
